 "remarks": "Elevated Living in Norwalk's Cranbury Section Discover refined city living in this newly renovated one-bedroom residence with a versatile loft, perched on the fourth floor of a sophisticated elevator building. Step onto your private balcony and take in sweeping city views - a perfect backdrop for morning coffee or evening unwinding. Thoughtfully updated with modern finishes throughout, this home offers the loft as an elegant extension of your living space, ideal for a private office, reading nook, or guest retreat. Enjoy effortless access to Club Studio Fitness, Walmart, and ASML Corporation, all just moments away, with ample street parking for you and your guests. A rare opportunity to call this exceptional residence home. Asking: $2,500/month | Security: $3,750 No pets. No smoking.",
